    "detailed_description": "<strong>Looping Bravery</strong> is a <i>sci-fi deckbuilding roguelike card battler</i>. Save the world from an alien invasion by traveling back in time to stop an event knows as <strong>&quot;The Marking&quot;</strong>. <br><br>Fight versus various groups in the past and find out about the long lasting rivalry between RED vs BLUE organisation and their fight for supremacy.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1909260/extras/3f67fedd77607b5c12707a7390a51010.poster.avif?t=1726271997\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1909260/extras/3f67fedd77607b5c12707a7390a51010.webm?t=1726271997\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1909260/extras/3f67fedd77607b5c12707a7390a51010.mp4?t=1726271997\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br>At the start, pick <strong>two weapons</strong>, one offensive and one defensive to help you on your journey.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1909260/extras/d2046787e9bc58146bb44cdcc95bb0d1.poster.avif?t=1726271997\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1909260/extras/d2046787e9bc58146bb44cdcc95bb0d1.webm?t=1726271997\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1909260/extras/d2046787e9bc58146bb44cdcc95bb0d1.mp4?t=1726271997\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br>Use your hard earned <strong>antimatter</strong>  with your <strong>TMD (time manipulation device)</strong> to manipulate the turns to your advantage in combat.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"htt