hared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1909260/extras/8badcb3b9b826e544a4a41d14761d3af.poster.avif?t=1726271997\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1909260/extras/8badcb3b9b826e544a4a41d14761d3af.webm?t=1726271997\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1909260/extras/8badcb3b9b826e544a4a41d14761d3af.mp4?t=1726271997\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br>Use over <strong>240 unique weapon cards</strong> to defeat your enemies.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1909260/extras/e45dc4e35b5d87781e857d8761e64f8a.poster.avif?t=1726271997\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1909260/extras/e45dc4e35b5d87781e857d8761e64f8a.webm?t=1726271997\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1909260/extras/e45dc4e35b5d87781e857d8761e64f8a.mp4?t=1726271997\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br>Choose from more than <strong>30 items</strong> that bend the rules to of the game.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1909260/extras/edec438ebe618ddd8bdc5285fda0ac70.poster.avif?t=1726271997\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1909260/extras/edec438ebe618ddd8bdc5285fda0ac70.webm?t=1726271997\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1909260/extras/edec438ebe618ddd8bdc5285fda0ac70.mp4?t=1726271997\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br>Uncover the story by engaging in conversations with enemies and gain various rewards at the end of every dialogue, b